Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.60,0:02:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}寂靜的交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.10,0:03:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點才能連接的詛咒網站
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.60,0:03:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能夠登錄的只有充滿怨恨的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這邊請
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.70,0:03:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請坐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我馬上就走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:48.90,0:03:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別那麼急啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝點兒咖啡怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山本聖良小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.40,0:03:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別叫我名字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把照片和底片給我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.70,0:04:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以數一下嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別開玩笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.80,0:04:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,藝人總是引人注目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.10,0:04:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩起來也不自由吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這些就是全部了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.60,0:04:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個請您相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今後要小心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.20,0:04:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人渣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.30,0:04:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 聽說過地獄少女嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,據說可以幫人消除怨恨的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.50,0:04:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是傷人啊 那個態度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.80,0:04:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 正好到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.20,0:04:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被恨的人看來不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.00,0:05:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祐子 我會幫你消除怨恨的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣的 婆婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.80,0:05:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我遇到了一個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.90,0:05:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.40,0:05:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 不知怎麼覺得很懷念
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.40,0:05:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懷念
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼奇怪的話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.60,0:05:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.60,0:06:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呢 很奇怪呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.10,0:06:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 又來了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.40,0:06:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別一邊搞電腦一邊喫東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.90,0:06:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真沒教養
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亂扔煮雞蛋纔沒有教養吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.40,0:06:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.50,0:06:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子變壞的頭等原因就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.50,0:06:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父母的品行不端
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 那我們家就沒問題了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.60,0:07:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲有這麼棒的爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.70,0:07:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開玩笑啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對了 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說過地獄少女嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女 那個復仇代理人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.80,0:07:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對對 你的朋友裏有誰知道的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.70,0:07:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有沒有看到過那個地獄通信網站的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要將它寫成報道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.20,0:07:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 復仇代理人的真相
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會熱賣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.90,0:07:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是不要的好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.20,0:07:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.50,0:07:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.30,0:07:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.70,0:08:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 振作一點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.40,0:08:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.90,0:08:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄 少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.90,0:08:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙在笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼沒有來啊 地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.40,0:08:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在上網啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.90,0:08:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 用這玩藝兒查找東西方便多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.00,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天鶇似乎精神不大好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.70,0:08:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是心情有點不好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.50,0:08:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也漸漸到了容易抵抗的年齡了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然知道你工作很辛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.90,0:08:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶爾也帶她去次遊樂場怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.70,0:09:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那丫頭會不會高興呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她相當早熟啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.30,0:09:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然看上去是如此 但內心畢竟還是孩子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.80,0:09:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那下次週末帶她去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.00,0:09:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遊樂場啊 我看她肯定不會高興
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.30,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(830,135)}28 姓名 傳說中的無名氏
