Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.00,0:09:25.50,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(35,190)}坦然自若的坐在那裏喫喝的一種妖怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.60,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(830,135)}28 姓名 傳說中的無名氏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.60,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(805,188)}地獄 溫泉   好想去———
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.60,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(775,93)}29 姓名 和尚頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.30,0:09:23.60,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(750,134)}好像很熱的樣子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.60,0:09:25.80,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(830,87)}30 姓名 GBC39
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.60,0:09:25.80,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(805,209)}我用過地獄通信。希望她幫我消
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.60,0:09:25.80,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(780,209)}除怨恨，發了郵件卻沒有答覆。
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.00,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(830,135)}31 姓名 傳說中的無名氏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.00,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(805,90)}別騙人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.00,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(775,135)}32 姓名 傳說中的無名氏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.80,0:09:27.00,*Default1,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\pos(750,100)}煩不煩啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,GBC 39
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(585,78)}漢堡連鎖GBC
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.50,0:09:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是和怨恨沒關係的店啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.30,0:09:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞錯了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.70,0:10:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祐子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到終點站了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這 這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.80,0:10:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.70,0:11:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.30,0:11:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.30,0:11:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你恨那個男人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.05,0:11:07.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恨到想要殺死他嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.70,0:11:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲 那傢伙的錯祐子才
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.70,0:11:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,輪入道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.90,0:11:18.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.60,0:11:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.00,0:11:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.10,0:11:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:42.00,0:11:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.90,0:11:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.40,0:11:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.50,0:11:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.30,0:12:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.00,0:12:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.80,0:12:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂也將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.70,0:12:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是死以後的事情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.30,0:12:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂將飽嘗痛楚與苦難永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.50,0:12:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.00,0:12:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊 救命啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:42.90,0:12:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.00,0:13:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牛奶 幫你留了點兒哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.00,0:13:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.90,0:13:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝吧 要不胸部會長不大的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,性騷擾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.40,0:13:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是父母心啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:26.10,0:13:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還在查啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.90,0:13:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.40,0:13:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.10,0:13:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是的不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:32.90,0:13:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經沒有在查了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.60,0:13:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.20,0:13:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一去洗澡的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:40.60,0:13:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查過歷史記錄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.70,0:13:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 既然你這麼想查也無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心點哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.30,0:13:52.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 哦 我會小心的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.40,0:13:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我點牛奶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.40,0:14:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看…看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是漢堡店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.60,0:14:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.60,0:14:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,田沼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是不幹了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.80,0:14:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是來見店長的 他在嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 店長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:38.20,0:14:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 什麼事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:43.00,0:14:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊 是田沼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.20,0:14:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 剩下的工資應該已經匯給你了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.00,0:14:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能出來一下嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.70,0:14:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有39的字吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.10,0:14:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.30,0:15:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是笨蛋 叫你待在家裏還硬要我帶你出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.60,0:15:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 阿一看不見不是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.00,0:15:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次 帶你去遊樂場玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遊樂場啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.00,0:15:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼把我叫到這種地方來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.00,0:15:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對了 木戶她怎麼樣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.00,0:15:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚇了一跳啊 聽說她跳樓的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.30,0:15:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒看出來她這麼煩惱啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道原因了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.70,0:15:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是失戀什麼的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你推下去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.60,0:16:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別裝傻了 我都知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.30,0:16:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.00,0:16:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是過分的誣賴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我從祐子那裏聽說了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.30,0:16:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在賬本上搞鬼 盜用了店裏的錢款
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.00,0:16:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祐子因爲喜歡你 所以沒有報警
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.80,0:16:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算來說服你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.80,0:16:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把錢全部還進去 就當什麼也沒發生過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.00,0:16:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天在手機中跟我說的 之後就要去見你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.00,0:16:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祐子一直很喜歡你 可是你卻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.50,0:16:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 田沼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.70,0:16:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒有推她下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:40.00,0:16:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再說謊了 我看見了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.00,0:16:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天 我非常擔心就去那幢大樓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.90,0:16:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.70,0:16:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的 不是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.40,0:16:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.80,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有證據嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.40,0:17:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,證據什麼無所謂 我看見了那就足夠了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你跟警察說也沒用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天我有不在場證明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.80,0:17:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會去報警
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.40,0:17:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女會幫我報仇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.90,0:17:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個在網上鬧的沸沸揚揚的傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.40,0:17:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,認真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.30,0:17:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白癡啊你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.70,0:17:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種東西根本就不存在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,存在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.70,0:17:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在讓閻魔愛替我消除怨恨之前  我只想知道一點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.70,0:17:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關於那天的事情 你是怎麼想的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.60,0:17:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在我終於明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:47.80,0:17:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那根本不是事故 你根本沒把祐子當回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.90,0:17:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,終於明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.20,0:17:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可憐啊 祐子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.60,0:18:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千惠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.40,0:18:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千惠 其實我以前就對你…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:06.60,0:18:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少開玩笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是個什麼人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.50,0:18:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到你是這種人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差勁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.80,0:18:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.40,0:18:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起的友情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.60,0:18:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是太愚蠢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.40,0:18:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.30,0:18:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.00,0:18:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:40.70,0:18:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.20,0:18:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.90,0:18:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.20,0:19:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人 有人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.40,0:19:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這邊 這邊哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.10,0:19:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.50,0:20:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 這裏到底
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:05.00,0:20:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祐子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.10,0:20:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我好想見你 吾郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.70,0:20:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.20,0:20:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨…笨蛋 快住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.30,0:20:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 一起摔下去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.10,0:20:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來吧 這次是兩個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.70,0:20:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少開玩笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.80,0:20:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.80,0:20:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:45.80,0:20:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.00,0:21:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叛于思亦懲於念
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.30,0:21:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:13.60,0:21:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.60,0:21:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 發生了什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.00,0:21:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 什麼也沒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.60,0:21:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:48.60,0:21:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:52.40,0:21:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也送你回家吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:59.50,0:22:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.50,0:22:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你認識嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.00,0:22:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:06.00,0:22:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.00,0:22:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.90,0:22:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.20,0:22:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祐子 我以前也喜歡那傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.00,0:22:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說不定那時也可能是我變成你這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.80,0:22:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.90,0:22:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:50.88,0:22:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(192,218)\fad(0,800)}找不到您要找的網頁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:57.30,0:23:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.60,0:23:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:22.10,0:23:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:29.00,0:23:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
